      "key": "notes",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/30-amphibians-and-reptiles/pipa_parva_en/",
      "html": "<p>At first glimpse these nice animals remind one of Dwarf Clawed Frogs (Hymenochirus). However, like all other Pipa species, P. parva has ramifications on the top of each finger, which always allow a correct identification.</p>"
